    Name of <ph name="SPACE_NAME">$1<ex>Work</ex></ph>
  </message>
  <message name="IDS_COMPASS_SETTINGS_WINDOW_SPACES_NEW_PROFILE_ELLIPSIS" desc="Menu choice that moves the space to a new profile.">
